<wpt lat="50.128940" lon="5.790700"><name>DZC Houffalize — the Panther</name><desc>Tour day 4

Where the US 1st and 3rd Armies met on 16 January to close the Bulge; a German Panther tank sits in the town centre.

Same day Easy took Rachamps, 10 km south.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/holland-bastogne.html

