<wpt lat="50.410060" lon="5.845590"><name>DZC December 44 Museum, La Gleize</name><desc>Tour day 4

The high-water mark of Kampfgruppe Peiper on the northern shoulder, with a King Tiger outside.

The German side of the offensive.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/holland-bastogne.html

