<wpt lat="50.403690" lon="6.066740"><name>DZC Baugnez crossroads — Malmedy massacre memorial</name><desc>Tour day 4

The crossroads where 84 American prisoners were shot on 17 December. The Baugnez 44 Historical Center beside it closed permanently in January 2023; the memorial wall and the field remain open.

Place of remembrance first.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/holland-bastogne.html

