<wpt lat="48.816264" lon="7.797611"><name>DZC Liberation memorial — Moder canal</name><desc>Tour day 5

On Boulevard de la Libération, marking where American tanks crossed the Moder canal on 16 March 1945 for the town's final liberation — three weeks after Easy left.

The bronze reliefs show the crossing.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/holland-bastogne.html

