<wpt lat="48.812890" lon="7.791880"><name>DZC Haguenau centre &amp; Musée Historique</name><desc>Tour day 5

The old Alsatian town Easy knew as a half-ruined front line; the history museum covers the two liberations of 1944–45.

Compare the intact streets today with the shelled town of February 1945.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/holland-bastogne.html

