<wpt lat="48.968000" lon="7.914000"><name>DZC Fort de Schoenenbourg — Maginot Line</name><desc>Tour day 5

The largest visitable Maginot fort in Alsace, 20 km north: kilometres of galleries and turrets. Context for the fortified border the 1945 winter fighting sat on.

Bring a jacket — 12 °C underground.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/holland-bastogne.html

