<wpt lat="51.502770" lon="5.419210"><name>DZC Joe Mann memorial, Best</name><desc>Extra stop

Pvt. Joe Mann of the 502nd threw himself on a grenade at the Best bridge fight on 19 September; Medal of Honor. The pelican memorial stands in the woods where the 502nd fought.

Ten minutes from the Wings of Liberation museum.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/holland-bastogne.html

