<wpt lat="51.920950" lon="5.801140"><name>DZC 506th PIR memorial, Elst</name><desc>Extra stop

Memorial to the 506th on the Island, in the town the regiment held in October–November 1944.

On the way from Driel to the Heteren crossroads.

Accuracy: Documented site.

Guide: https://dzcharlie.com/holland-bastogne.html

